{"subtitle":"","author":"子戈","category":"专栏 · 看片指南","collection":"","publishedAt":"2026-02-01T19:40","status":"published","cover":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-001.jpg","festival":"","partnership":false,"id":"img-9183","title":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么","archiveCategory":"guide","blocks":[{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 1","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-001.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 2","caption":"","width":70,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-002.jpg","imageText":"2月院线看片指南>>D"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 3","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-003.jpg","imageText":"春节档大战 ——6部\nSpring Festival Film"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 4","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-004.jpg","imageText":"《镖人：风起大漠》\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:2月17日1第3个周二(春节档)出品方:大麦&登峰／导演:袁和平预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5/票房12-18亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点武侠片能否征服春节档？剧情片：动作／武侠／古装／125‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"没记错的话，还没有任何一部古装武侠片能征服春节档。这一方面与该片种的日渐式微有关，一方面也与春节档自身调性有关。去年徐克作品的惨状，还历历在目。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"不过这部漫改片《镖人》，倒是有望实现突破。毕竟，四代武侠人大聚首的阵仗，大漠孤烟、隋末江湖的景象，还是让人颇为期待。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"从目前放出的预告片看，较为中规中矩。究竟如何，正片见分晓。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 5","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-005.jpg","imageText":"《飞驰人生3》\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：2月17日1第3个周二（春节档）出品方：亭东&猫眼/导演：韩寒预计：豆瓣分7.0-8.0／票房30-36亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点春节档头号种子，就它了。剧情片：喜剧／运动／125‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"目前进军春节档的六部电影里，这一部无疑卖相最好。老IP、喜剧、燃，不再愤世嫉俗的韩寒，已成为了这个时代最主流的导演。而且据说这次不是个人赛，而是要代表中国出战。民族主义大旗，韩寒也是扛起来了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本来有传言，贾玲的《转念花开》也要定档春节，如此一来，2023年《热辣滚烫》大战《飞驰人生2》的好戏，将上演二番。结果，《转念》一转念，很可能要去暑期档花开了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"韩寒倒是决定一条路走到黑，不转了，此次依旧“全男阵容”，和时代潮流做着最小代价的对抗。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 6","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-006.jpg","imageText":"《惊蛰无声》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：2月17日1第3个周二(春节档)出品方：大麦&中中／导演：张艺谋预计:豆瓣分6.5-7.5/票房16-20亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点²你国师，永远是你国师。剧情片：谍战／犯罪／110‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"张艺谋前年刚接了最高检的单子，拍了《第二十条》，这次又接了国安部的单子，有了这部号称“首部国安题材作品”的《惊蛰无声》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这回喜剧没有融进来，从预告看，是标准犯罪片，有点双雄味道，外加劣质网感。最后想告诉大家的，无非那一句“间谍就在身边”。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"多恐怖啊，大过节的。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 7","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-007.jpg","imageText":"《星河入梦》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:2月17日1第3个周二(春节档）出品方：中影&横店/导演：韩延预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房4-8亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点² 韩延这次不催泪了？剧情片：奇幻／冒险","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"两韩相争，必有一伤。不过两位韩导倒是同病相怜，都曾被春节档深深伤害过。韩寒的《四海》、韩延的《我们一起摇太阳》，都曾因调性严重不符，折戟春节。这次正面对战的，是早已学乖了的韩寒，和刚刚学乖的韩延。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这部《星河入梦》，至少表面看，那是极其的没心没肺、插科打浑。基本就是把《盗梦空间》套了个《妈的多重宇宙》的外壳，讲一个无限穿梦的故事。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预告片看，挺山寨的。宣传主打“年轻人特供”，不知道年轻人买账否？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 8","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-008.jpg","imageText":"《熊猫计划之部落奇遇记》\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：2月17日1第3个周二（春节档）出品方：猫眼&峨眉／导演：许宏宇预计:豆瓣分5.5-6.5/票房4-8亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点大熊猫版《我是谁》。剧情片：喜剧／奇幻","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"前作《熊猫计划》垮成那样，一没想到，还能有续集，二没想到，还敢进春节档。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"也是看中了去年影市整体疲软的状况下，亲子市场仍然坚挺，所以这部显然是整个档期内“合家欢气质”最浓的影片，才动了心思，觉得自己没准真能小有作为。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但实际情况不容乐观，成龙+熊猫+东北一家人的组合，无论大人小孩，恐怕都提不起太大兴趣吧。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 9","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-009.jpg","imageText":"《熊出没·年年有熊》\n6.0\n年年有熊\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:2月17日1第3个周二(春节档)出品方：方特&横店／导演：林汇达预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5/票房10-15亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点今年春节档唯一动画片。动画片：喜剧／奇幻","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"片如其名，年年有熊。去年因为有《哪吒2》，影响了这个IP的表现，但最终也有8.21亿进账。今年缺乏同类竞争，10亿+几乎是板上钉钉。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但考虑到自2016年以来持续下降的出生率，“熊出没”的好日子，还能有多久呢？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"值得关注- ——3部It's Noteworthy","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 10","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-010.jpg","imageText":"《爱乐之城》(重映)\n70\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：2月14日1第2个周六（情人节）出品方：顶峰娱乐/导演：达米安·查泽雷豆瓣分（截至目前)8.4／预计票房800-1500万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点²上映十周年，经典重映。剧情片：歌舞／爱情／128°","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"第一次登陆内地院线，是2017年的情人节,如今将近十年过去了，本片迎来了第二次重映，仍然选在情人节这天。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"如今看，依然是非常经典的爱情电影，歌好听，舞好看，爱情只能回味。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 11","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-011.jpg","imageText":"《藏地情书》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：2月14日1第2个周六(情人节)出品方：猫眼＆爱奇艺／导演：久美成列预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0／票房1000-3000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点《藏地白皮书》改编电影。剧情片：爱情／真人真事改编","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片改编自2008年的畅销书《藏地白皮书》，由一对情侣傅真、毛铭基所写，那时正值非典时期，傅是大四学生，即将赴英国留学，毛是香港男孩，两人在拉萨的青年旅舍偶遇，爱情在沉默中萌芽。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片由万玛才旦编剧，其子久美成列导演，拍摄中途，万玛导演去世。万玛的每部作品，都是藏地情书。不知道久美成列的这一封，写的是怎样的情绪。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 12","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-012.jpg","imageText":"《鹿鼎记2》（老片新映）\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：2月7日1第1个周六出品方：永盛/导演：王晶","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"豆瓣分（截至目前)8.2/预计票房80-150万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点²又见周星星。剧情片：喜剧／动作／古装／98°","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"去年12月，《鹿鼎记》首次登陆内地，票房只有128.4万，这次《鹿鼎记2》也来了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"而我只纳闷，星爷的《女足》到底什么时候来?","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 13","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-013.jpg","imageText":"谨慎观看 ——2部\nPlease Don't Watch!"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 14","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-014.jpg","imageText":"《喜欢上“欠欠”的你》\n欢\n5.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：2月14日1第2个周六(情人节)出品方：火花闪耀／导演：翁子光","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5／票房2000-5000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"槽点 限韩令也限不住翻拍韩国片。剧情片：喜剧／爱情","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"导演竟然是翁子光，差点以为我看错了。很难想象，近年来的“大尺度奇案片”专业户，会拍这么一部清新寡淡的都市爱情片。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"翻拍自韩国电影《爱情储蓄罐》，据说早在疫情前已经杀青。大概情节就是女的骗男的，骗着骗着成真了。限韩令解没解除不知道，反正翻拍韩国片，我们是没停过。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"2026春节档要凉？丨2月院线看什么 · 配图 15","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9183/fig-015.jpg","imageText":"《营救汪星人》(重映）\n萌宠动作急验\nTEAB\n4.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:2月14日1第2个周六(情人节）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：星汇天姬/导演：梁婷","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分4.5-5.5/票房100-300万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"槽点狗狗是无辜的。剧情片：喜剧／冒险／105°","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"纯纯的烂片，2018年上映过，看的人很少，绝大多数都是1星。这次又被拿回来，无非是因为主演翻红，要趁机捞一笔。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但我觉得粉丝不会开心，不如先想想办法营救自家哥哥吧。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"编辑/子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"排版/令令奇","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本文配图来自网络","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"欢迎参与投票：","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这个春节档，打算看哪几部？多选 多选","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"A.《镖人：风起大漠》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"B.《飞驰人生3》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"C.《惊蛰无声》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"D. 《星河入梦》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"E. 《熊猫计划之部落奇遇记》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"F. 《《熊出没·年年有熊》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"G.一部都不看","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"H.路过只看结果","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"投票","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"preface":[{"text":"这个春节档，片方普遍都在观望，导致定档节奏被大大拖后。截至目前，终于凑成了六大种子选手。不过看下来，还是不免让人为2026的开年走势担心。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"去年靠《哪吒2》的一口气撑到年底的景象，是不可能再复制了。那么今年靠谁呢？观众们、影院们、我们，也只能继续观望。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"稿主笔 子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"prefaceOffset":2}